1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Flat ground — or a hidden tilt?
{\fs13}I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,500
The Forbidden City looks dead level. It isn't.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:11,000
The north end sits almost two metres higher than the south.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,500
North gate: 46.05 m. Meridian Gate, south: 44.28 m.

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:20,000
Under two metres of fall, across nearly a kilometre of courtyards.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Double-tap if you'd have called it flat.

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,000
So the rain runs off on its own — into the Inner Golden River, then the moat.

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Dense walls slow it, but 600 years on it still drains.

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Flat or tilted — did you know? Tell me I'm wrong below.
